          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display text-crst-primary mb-4">How Long Does a Direct Mail Campaign Take?</h2>
          <p class="text-navy-600/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Standard turnaround at Cornerstone is 7–10 business days from approved proof to post office induction. USPS Marketing Mail then delivers in 3–5 business days for local Hudson Valley mailings in Ulster, Dutchess, and Orange counties — 7–10 days for national campaigns. Total time from kick-off to in-home: plan for 15–20 business days if starting from scratch.
          </p>
          <p class="text-navy-600/80 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For established clients with pre-approved templates and a clean list, 10–12 business days is achievable. Rush production is available when the schedule allows — call to confirm availability. Election mail and time-sensitive campaigns get priority scheduling. For more detail on how <a href="/direct-mail-tools/usps-notice-67" class="text-crst-accent hover:underline">mail automation specs</a> affect turnaround, see our Notice 67 reference.
